2. In the browser address bar type *https://code.visualstudio.com/* and presee the **Return** key on the keyboard. *- red ring* 

3. The vscode website is displayed.

4. Click the **Download** button. *- yellow ring* 

{{::il.Firefox_vscode_img}}

5. The download page is displayed and the download starts.

6. When vscode has finished downloading the browser should show notify you like Firefox does in image below. *- red ring* 

7. Click the downloaded file to run the installer. *- yellow ring* 

{{::il.Firefox_vscode_downloaded_img}}

